46	        "publish_set": "Rooted at the repo root. The site is the four pages (index, accessibility, privacy, terms), the favicons and .nojekyll, css/, js/, shared/, the planner's own paths (plan/index.html, plan/plan.css, plan/plan.js, plan/lib), package.json (the debug pill fetches it for the version), and only the data the browser actually fetches: data/venues.json, data/days/, and the three normalized sidecars the planner loads (shows.min.json, availability.min.json, descriptions.min.json). Derived from the fetch call sites in js/app.js and plan/plan.js, not from 'everything except the tooling'. Deliberately excluded: data/normalized/shows.json (7.4M) and data/prices.json (2.9M) are scraper-side inputs no page fetches, plus scraper/, docs/, design-concepts/, product-wiki/, plan/design/, scripts/ and the agent tooling."
